      "",
      "<h2>From the roastery</h2><p>What actually happens between a sack of green coffee and the cup in front of you. Filmed on the roastery floor on ordinary weekday mornings — nothing staged, and the occasional batch we got wrong.</p>",
      {}
    ],
    [
      "html",
      "",
      "<div class=\"cms-video-gallery cms-video-gallery-3\">\n<div class=\"cms-video-thumb\" data-video-src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-1.mp4\"><video src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-1.mp4#t=0.1\" preload=\"metadata\" muted playsinline></video><span class=\"cms-play-icon\">&#9658;</span><span class=\"cms-video-caption\">In the roaster</span></div>\n<div class=\"cms-video-thumb\" data-video-src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-2.mp4\"><video src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-2.mp4#t=0.1\" preload=\"metadata\" muted playsinline></video><span class=\"cms-play-icon\">&#9658;</span><span class=\"cms-video-caption\">Pulling a shot</span></div>\n<div class=\"cms-video-thumb\" data-video-src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-3.mp4\"><video src=\"/static/video/templates/coffee-shop-media-3.mp4#t=0.1\" preload=\"metadata\" muted playsinline></video><span class=\"cms-play-icon\">&#9658;</span><span class=\"cms-video-caption\">Latte art</span></div>\n</div>",
